[agent] Now I understand the task. I need to:
[agent] 1. Load user embeddings, item embeddings, and interactions
[agent] 2. For each user, compute dot products between their embedding and all item embeddings
[agent] 3. Exclude items the user has already interacted with
[agent] 4. Rank top-5 by relevance (dot product), breaking ties by ascending item_id
[agent] 5. Create a feature table named `recsed2647` version 1 with columns: rec_id, user_id, rank, item_id
[agent] 6. Make it available for online/real-time lookup
